# The 6.18 firmware loader overrides the caller's credentials with kernel
# credentials. Making only recovery/ueventd permissive cannot authorize its
# system:firmware_load check. Ramdisk files are rootfs; mounted vendor/odm
# firmware is vendor_file; userspace fallback uses the kernel's own context.
# Requires 0006-kernel-firmware-permission.patch in system/sepolicy.
recovery_only(`
    allow kernel { self rootfs vendor_file }:system firmware_load;
    r_dir_file(kernel, vendor_file)
')
